    "Four pillars: blood pressure on target, weight trend, mood stability, medication compliance. Missing pillars are redistributed proportionally across the ones present — the score never lies about what was actually measured.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vier Säulen: Blutdruck im Ziel, Gewichts-Trend, Stimmungs-Stabilität, Medikamenten-Therapietreue. Fehlende Säulen werden anteilig auf die vorhandenen verteilt. So lügt der Score nie über das, was tatsächlich gemessen wurde."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Four pillars: blood pressure on target, weight trend, mood stability, medication compliance. Missing pillars are redistributed proportionally across the ones present, so the score never lies about what was actually measured."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "네 가지 항목: 목표 범위 내 혈압, 체중 추세, 기분 안정성, 복약 순응도. 빠진 항목의 비중은 있는 항목에 비율대로 다시 나눠요. 그래서 점수는 실제로 측정한 것에 대해 절대 속이지 않아요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
