            "value": "코치가 지금 바빠요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해 주세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Coach is currently unavailable.": {
      "comment": "v0.5.7 G.3 — AskCoachSheet inline error banner copy for .foundationModelsUnavailable / .notWiredYet.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Coach ist gerade nicht erreichbar."
          }
        },
        "en": {
