            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 주소에는 호스트 부분이 없어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app version doesn't know this measurement yet": {
      "comment": "Secondary hint — unknown metric explains itself",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese App-Version kennt diesen Messwert noch nicht"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app version doesn't know this measurement yet"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 앱 버전에서 아직 지원하지 않는 측정값이에요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clears the transcript on this iPhone. Conversations kept on your server stay — delete them under “Past conversations”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das löscht den Verlauf auf diesem iPhone. Unterhaltungen, die auf deinem Server liegen, bleiben erhalten. Die löschst du unter „Frühere Unterhaltungen“."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This clears the transcript on this iPhone. Conversations kept on your server stay. Delete them under “Past conversations”."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 iPhone의 대화 기록이 지워져요. 서버에 저장된 대화는 그대로 남아요. 서버의 대화는 “이전 대화”에서 삭제하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is still being processed. We'll retry automatically.": {
      "comment": "HLError user-facing copy — audit B-2: the server is still finishing the first request that carried this idempotency key.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird noch verarbeitet. Wird automatisch erneut versucht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is still being processed. We'll retry automatically."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "아직 처리 중이에요. 자동으로 다시 시도할게요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the first week with enough data for a score. There is nothing before it to compare against yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ist die erste Woche mit genug Daten für einen Wert. Davor liegt noch nichts zum Vergleichen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the first week with enough data for a score. There is nothing before it to compare against yet."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "점수를 계산할 만큼 데이터가 쌓인 첫 주예요. 아직 비교할 이전 데이터가 없어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link is shown only once. We can't show it again — copy or share it now. You can always revoke it later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Link wird nur einmal angezeigt. Wir können ihn nicht erneut anzeigen, also kopiere oder teile ihn jetzt. Du kannst ihn später jederzeit widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This link is shown only once. We can't show it again, so copy or share it now. You can always revoke it later."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 링크는 한 번만 표시돼요. 다시 보여 드릴 수 없으니 지금 복사하거나 공유하세요. 나중에 언제든 해지할 수 있어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This month": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
